WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.077 --> 00:00:02.303
^- Whooo, Chris Pratt and

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.683
^- Zoe Saldana.

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.280
^- And we're going to read some of these tweets,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.610
^and it's gonna be amazing.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.410
^- Shout out to the woman I heard coming out

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.304
^of the theater saying "Mmmm M'baku thick."

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.350
^- (laughs)

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.183
^- Okay.

00:00:15.183 --> 00:00:17.860
^- I'm here to announce my new favorite Disney princess

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.873
^is Shuri, she must be protected.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.133
^I would die for her.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.140
To be called a Disney princess,

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.463
it hasn't sunk in yet how amazing that is.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.430
It's actually overwhelming, I might cry

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.543
I have some fug tears.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:30.810
^Let's not do that.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.420
^- Mantis: the galaxy looks beautiful.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.393
^Drax: You know who else is beautiful.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:36.733
^Mantis: Me?

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.093
^Drax: No.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.743
^Ily, ely?

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.313
^I love you.

00:00:42.804 --> 00:00:44.913
^Ilysm: I love you so much.

00:00:45.526 --> 00:00:49.053
^Ildiwidwh: If Loki dies in Infinity War,

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:50.563
^I'm dying with him.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:51.813
Bless.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:55.070
^- Y'all think when Vision is dying in Infinity War

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:58.223
^they'll put him in a bag of rice and hope for the best?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.500
^- It says in Guardians of the Galaxy Volume One,

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.143
^Peter Quill has mommy issues.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:04.513
^In volume two, he has daddy issues.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:07.843
^In Infinity War, he has in-law issues.

00:01:08.187 --> 00:01:09.993
^(laughs) Ain't that the truth son.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.330
^- Cancel Infinity War and just give me two hours

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:18.330
^of Pepper, Okoye, oh, Shuri, Nakia, Nat, Gamora

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.640
^and Valkyrie just sitting in a room talking about

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.310
^how stupid the men in their lives are.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:26.080
^- Wanda Maximoff is the strongest Avenger

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.690
^and she will be the one to save the universe

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:29.950
^and defeat Thanos.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.960
^Once she does that all you haters are gonna

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.023
^give her the recognition she deserve.

00:01:34.148 --> 00:01:35.199
^- (laughs)

00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:36.755
Okay, well first off I didn't know I had haters.

00:01:36.755 --> 00:01:38.290
^(laughter)

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:40.560
^- I wanna know if Bucky got to eat a plum

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.170
^before he went back on ice.

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:43.583
^I really hope he did.

00:01:45.214 --> 00:01:47.200
That's all he wanted was some plums back in Civil War,

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.250
^the rest was history.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.220
^- So I'll be honest, if Robert Downey Jr.'s Tony Stark

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:51.940
^doesn't at some point say "No shit, Sherlock"

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.130
^to Benny Cumbers' Dr. Strange,

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.980
^I'm going to consider Infinity War

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.480
^an utter and complete failure.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.890
It's an utter and complete failure.

00:01:59.414 --> 00:02:01.960
- I tried so hard to get that line in there.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.540
^- It's so corny.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.423
^- Drax be thinking like, "This is Iron Man?

00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:08.767
^He's not even made of iron."

00:02:09.214 --> 00:02:10.047
- [Don] (laughs)

00:02:10.047 --> 00:02:11.740
- That is what Drax be thinking like.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:12.573
^- [Don] Yeah.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.820
^- Starlord: Hey, you're the strongest avenger like by far.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.380
^- Thor: Okay, Gamora is absolutely the strongest guardian

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.023
^but thank you, I love you too.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.603
I am, I am the strongest.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:23.863
^- True, it's true.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:27.993
^- Everybody is excited to see who dies in #infinity war.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.740
^I'm just excited to see the banter

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.020
^between Rocket and Falcon.

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.820
I don't talk to raccoons, I eat 'em.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.830
^- Do you ever think that if Loki and Thor

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.013
^survived Infinity War, they would be close brothers again,

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.050
^and would start a whole new Asgard

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.113
^that peacefully ruled by both of them,

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.000
^and although it's too good to be true

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.083
^I still think it's beautiful in my dream.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:49.373
That's so sweet.

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.710
Well that is lovely, thank you for that.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:55.043
^Maybe it's a beautiful dream, let's leave it there shall we.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:57.270
^- Peter Parker showing up to Infinity War.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.290
^Teen Olympics overslept (laughs), lost coat,

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.690
^said (bleep) on TV, and won the U.S. first gold.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:03.080
That's definitely me.
- (laughs)

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:06.650
^- I hope Infinity war devotes several scenes to Shuri

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.413
^clowning Tony's tech.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.193
I do too.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.420
^- If Tony doesn't call Rhodey a stupid pet name

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.800
^and hugs him in Infinity War, then what's the point.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.693
You know, love Julie, I gotta agree.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.893
This is 10 years and coming,

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.150
I still don't have a stupid pet name from Tony,

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.310
and barely a hug.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.433
^We hugged once.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.870
^- Wanda says, "We should try spicing things up

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:27.703
^in the bedroom."

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.567
^- Vision says: "Oh, good idea."

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:31.693
^- Later.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:36.308
^Wanda: "What is this on the bed?"

00:03:36.308 --> 00:03:37.340
^- (whispers) It's paprika.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:40.320
^- Mantis is so underrated but if my soft girlfriend

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.820
^even has one scratch on her throughout Infinity War,

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.293
^I'm gonna fight Thanos and all his allies,

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.860
^Steve Roger's style.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.123
It's from a girl I think.

00:03:50.567 --> 00:03:51.400
- Yeah, she's asking--

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.460
- Oh, that's cool, yeah I'm a girlfriend.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.293
Thank you.

00:03:54.526 --> 00:03:56.750
^- Why is no one talking about Sam Wilson

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.363
^with a beard in the new Infinity War poster.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.463
Boom!

00:04:00.463 --> 00:04:02.950
I don't know, I think my beard looks actually

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.013
pretty good.

00:04:04.013 --> 00:04:05.430
To say I can't grow facial hair.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.073
- I thought it was very Shaft.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.713
- That's what I said.

00:04:09.174 --> 00:04:10.480
- I thought maybe that's what you're going for.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.550
^- Alice: This is the most brilliant British picture

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:13.463
^I've ever seen.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:16.810
Alice there's going to be a role waiting soon.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:20.200
^- April is Gamora, Derek is Peter Quill

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.793
- And Ben as Thor.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.473
- Okay so this is from Parks and Rec.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.623
So she's saying that this is you.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:27.463
- Uh huh.

00:04:27.994 --> 00:04:29.311
- And that is me and Hemsworth.

00:04:29.311 --> 00:04:30.144
- Oh.

00:04:30.585 --> 00:04:31.418
- Isn't that funny?

00:04:31.418 --> 00:04:32.290
You'd be like this is my boyfriend, Quill,

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.340
and this is his boyfriend, Thor (laughs).

00:04:34.947 --> 00:04:37.070
- But I have a question, are you both my boyfriends?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:37.903
- Yeah.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.277
^- She's a baddass.

00:04:39.277 --> 00:04:43.153
^- M'Baku could blow my M'Back out if he wanted to.

00:04:43.342 --> 00:04:45.592
(cheering)

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.656
- I've gotten the dirtiest tweets.

00:04:49.656 --> 00:04:50.657
- That's an awesome one.

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:51.490
- You got.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.193
- [Winston] I've gotten Disney after dark.

00:04:53.203 --> 00:04:55.228
That's what I got, that's what I got.

00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:56.602
- [Anthony] You got that Skinimax.

00:04:56.602 --> 00:04:58.671
- [Winston] (laughs)

